  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice capsicum.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook capsicum until tender, 5-6 minutes.\n• Transfer to a large bowl and allow to cool slightly.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a2654ccf83cc16a33c3d905/step-4cb34000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop cucumber.\n• Slice lemon into wedges.\n• Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a2654ccf83cc16a33c3d905/step-45970910.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Microwave flatbreads on a microwave-safe plate in 10 second bursts until warmed through.\n• Wipe out frying pan, then return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Remove pan from heat, then add the honey, a pinch of chilli flakes (if using) and a good squeeze of lemon juice, turning haloumi to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a2654ccf83cc16a33c3d905/step-dd253c20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To bowl with cooled capsicum, add spinach & rocket mix, cucumber, a drizzle of olive oil and vinegar. Season and toss to combine.\n• Divide flatbreads, capsicum salad, honey haloumi and Greek-style yoghurt between plates. Tear over Dill.\n• Serve with any remaining salad and lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a2654ccf83cc16a33c3d905/step-3ebd8c30.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
